<div class="kl-column" style="display:table-cell;vertical-align:top;width:100%;">
<div class="mj-column-per-100 mj-outlook-group-fix component-wrapper" style="font-size:0px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;vertical-align:top;width:100%;">
<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="width:100%;" width="100%">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="" style="vertical-align:top;padding-top:9px;padding-right:18px;padding-bottom:9px;padding-left:18px;">
<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="" width="100%">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td align="left" class="kl-text" style="font-size:0px;padding:0px;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;word-break:break-word;">
<div style="font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;color:#393939;"><div> </div>
<p data-end="349" data-start="330">Hi <span style="font-size: 16px; font-family: Arial, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, sans-serif;">{!Lead.Name},</span></p>
<p data-end="466" data-start="400">Are you ready to stock a product that keeps customers coming back?</p>
<p data-end="826" data-start="468"><strong data-end="497" data-start="468">Introducing FRE® Original</strong> – the only high-strength, <em data-end="536" data-start="524">unflavored</em> moist pouch on the market. Engineered by nicotine users for nicotine users, FRE is designed for those who crave a bold, uncompromising nicotine experience. With a sleek feel, moist texture, and smooth satisfaction, FRE Original pouches deliver a next-level sensory experience—without the additives.</p>
<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="font-size: 0px; font-family: Times; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: left; height: 96px;" width="100%">
<tbody>
<tr style="height: 96px;">
<td align="left" class="kl-text" style="font-size: 0px; width: 100%; height: 96px;">
<div style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 150%; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(57, 57, 57); text-align: left;">
<div><strong><strong class="font-bold">Why carry FRE Original?</strong></strong></div>
<div>
<ul data-end="953" data-start="743">
<li data-end="818" data-start="743">
<p data-end="818" data-start="745" style="padding-bottom:0"><strong>Available in 5 Strengths </strong>– 3mg, 6mg, 9mg, 12mg, and 15mg to meet every user’s needs</p>
</li>
<li data-end="896" data-start="819">
<p data-end="896" data-start="821" style="padding-bottom:0"><strong>68% Reorder Rate</strong> – 7 in 10 FRE users return for more</p>
</li>
<li data-end="896" data-start="819">
<p data-end="896" data-start="821" style="padding-bottom:0"><strong>Nearly $1M in Daily Sales</strong> – FRE Original taps into a booming demand for high-strength flavorless pouches</p>
</li>
<li data-end="896" data-start="819"><strong>Customer Loyalty</strong> – “The 15mg hits harder than any other brand I’ve tried.” – Adam C.</li>
<li data-end="896" data-start="819"><strong>Moisture Matters</strong> – Our pre-primed pouches lock in nicotine and deliver consistently satisfying release, which is why 50% of pouch users prefer a moist pouch</li>
</ul>
<div><strong>Power. Feel. Flavorless:<br/></strong></div>
<div>
<div>FRE Original gives your customers exactly what they want—clean, high-potency pouches with no distractions. Available in both single cans and 100-count Mega Packs, FRE is built to scale with your business.</div>
<div><strong data-end="859" data-start="844"> </strong></div>
<div><strong>Ready to stock FRE Original?</strong></div>
<div>
<p data-end="1841" data-start="1603">Contact your rep or reply to this email and we’ll help you set up with point-of-sale assets like display stands, tin signs, and window clings to help FRE fly off your shelves.</p>
<p data-end="1873" data-start="1843" style="padding-bottom:0"><strong>Stand out. Stock FRE Original.</strong></p>
</div>
<div> </div>
<div>
<p data-end="1942" data-start="1801" style="padding-bottom:0">Best,</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
